(window.CsqPacks = window.CsqPacks || {})["data-detective"] = Object.assign(window.CsqPacks["data-detective"] || {}, { "zh-Hant": {"strings":{"Pro":"高手","Explorer":"新手","Player {n}":"玩家 {n}","Player {n}, your turn":"玩家 {n}，輪到你了","Swap! Pass the device.":"換人！把裝置交給下一位。","Solve mysteries with tables, charts and claims!":"用表格、圖表和說法來破解謎團！","Title screen":"標題畫面","Band: {band}":"等級：{band}","Two on one device":"兩人一台","Pair mode on: swap every three cases.":"雙人模式開啟：每三個案件換人。","Pair mode off.":"雙人模式關閉。","Pro cases: chapters 4 to 7. Chapter 1 is a warm-up.":"高手案件：第 4 到 7 章。第 1 章是暖身。","Explorer cases: chapters 1 to 3 and My Data.":"新手案件：第 1 到 3 章和「我的資料」。","Daily Crew Challenge":"每日團隊挑戰","One new case every day":"每天一個新案件","{n} of {total} stars":"{n} / {total} 顆星","Coming soon":"即將推出","{n} cases":"{n} 個案件","Chapter crown: every star":"章節皇冠：拿到每一顆星","Chapter map":"章節地圖","Hint":"提示","Learn card":"學習卡","Pause":"暫停","Class quest: {chapter} · {band}":"班級任務：{chapter} · {band}","Is this claim supported by the chart?":"這個說法有圖表的根據嗎？","The claim: “{claim}”":"說法：「{claim}」","Investigate":"調查","Got it":"知道了","Daily":"每日","{n} charts made, question {i} of {total}":"已做 {n} 張圖表，第 {i} / {total} 題","Case {n} of {total}, {stars} stars":"案件 {n} / {total}，{stars} 顆星","{done} of {n} runs finished ({rate}%).":"{n} 次中完成 {done} 次（{rate}%）。","Gap":"差距","Model":"模型","Real":"實際","Off by":"差了","Pick a question to start.":"選一個問題開始吧。","Ours %":"我們 %","Ours":"我們","Count":"數量","Other %":"別班 %","Other class":"別班","Class pool: {n} charts, {total} answers":"班級彙整：{n} 張圖表，{total} 個回答","Sort by {col}":"依{col}排序","Pictograph":"象形圖","Counts by {col}":"依{col}計數","Bar chart":"長條圖","{n} kids":"{n} 位小朋友","Table":"表格","Bars":"長條","Pictures":"圖案","Another class":"另一班","Show percent":"顯示百分比","Class pool":"班級彙整","Group by {col}":"依{col}分組","Run {n} tests":"執行 {n} 次測試","Run {n} trials":"執行 {n} 次試驗","Rule":"規則","The rule moved. Run the trials again to test it.":"規則變了。再做一次試驗來測試它。","Predict first: set the rule, then run the trials.":"先預測：設定規則，再做試驗。","That is about 8 in 10: balanced!":"大約 10 次中有 8 次：剛剛好！","Target: about 8 in 10 finish. Refine the jump.":"目標：大約 10 次中 8 次完成。調整跳躍。","Average miss: {n}%.":"平均差距：{n}%。","The model fits!":"模型符合了！","Not yet: refine the rule and run again.":"還沒：修改規則，再試一次。","Runs so far: {n}.":"目前次數：{n}。","Question":"問題","{cat}: one less":"{cat}：少一個","{cat}: one more":"{cat}：多一個","Answers: {n}":"回答：{n}","Five answers is the least that counts as a case.":"至少要五個回答才算一個案件。","Add to class pool":"加入班級彙整","{n} charts pooled":"已彙整 {n} 張圖表","Table: {n}":"表格：{n}","My prediction for {label}":"我對{label}的預測","Row: {name}. What should happen to it?":"這一列：{name}。要怎麼處理？","Fix, merge, remove, or keep it as it is.":"修正、合併、刪除，或保持原樣。","Fix to {value}":"改成{value}","Merge (a repeat)":"合併（重複）","Remove (impossible)":"刪除（不可能）","Keep it":"保留","Added. {n} charts pooled.":"已加入。已彙整 {n} 張圖表。","Show me! Tap the bar or row that proves it.":"證明給我看！點一下能證明的長條或列。","Show me! Tap the evidence that proves it.":"證明給我看！點一下能證明的證據。","{n} more to tap":"還要點 {n} 個","Pin this prediction":"釘選這個預測","Pick {n}":"選 {n} 個","Pin a claim":"釘選說法","The view supports a claim. Pin one!":"這個畫面能支持一個說法。釘選一個吧！","Make a chart with at least {n} answers, then pin a claim.":"做一張至少有 {n} 個回答的圖表，再釘選說法。","Show me: the claim card opens when the model fits the trials.":"證明給我看：模型符合試驗時，說法卡就會打開。","Show me: the claim card opens when the view on screen answers the question.":"證明給我看：畫面能回答問題時，說法卡就會打開。","Show me first: chart at least {n} answers, then pin your claim.":"先證明：圖表至少要有 {n} 個回答，再釘選你的說法。","Show me first: refine the rule until the model fits the trials, then pin it.":"先證明：修改規則直到模型符合試驗，再釘選它。","Show me first: get the view that answers the question on screen, then pin your claim.":"先證明：讓畫面顯示能回答問題的檢視，再釘選你的說法。","Pin these {n}":"釘選這 {n} 個","Look again":"再看一次","Skip this case":"跳過這個案件","Not that one. Which row or bar shows it?":"不是那個喔。哪一列或哪一條長條能說明？","Yes! Keep going: tap the rest of the evidence.":"對！繼續：點其他的證據。","Good claim! Now show me: tap the bar or row that proves it.":"好說法！現在證明給我看：點能證明的長條或列。","Good claim! Now show me: tap the evidence that proves it.":"好說法！現在證明給我看：點能證明的證據。","Skipped. No stars this time, but the next case is open.":"已跳過。這次沒有星星，但下一個案件已經打開。","{done} of {n} finished: about 8 in 10. Balanced! Pin the result.":"{n} 次中完成 {done} 次：大約 10 次中 8 次。剛剛好！釘選結果。","{done} of {n} finished. Too easy: lower the jump and test again.":"{n} 次中完成 {done} 次。太簡單：降低跳躍，再測一次。","{done} of {n} finished. Too hard: raise the jump and test again.":"{n} 次中完成 {done} 次。太難：提高跳躍，再測一次。","The model fits the trials. Pin the rule!":"模型符合試驗。釘選規則！","The model predicts too little. Refine the rule and run again.":"模型預測得太少。修改規則，再試一次。","The model predicts too much. Refine the rule and run again.":"模型預測得太多。修改規則，再試一次。","That view answers it. Pin your claim!":"這個檢視回答了問題。釘選你的說法！","Chart made! {n} so far.":"圖表完成！目前 {n} 張。","Case closed! {n} of 3 stars.":"破案了！{n} / 3 顆星。","Chart made!":"圖表完成！","Case closed!":"破案了！","Case skipped":"案件已跳過","Chart {n} made!":"第 {n} 張圖表完成！","Make another chart, or finish and see your total.":"再做一張圖表，或結束看看總數。","Another chart":"再一張圖表","Finish":"結束","Chapter crown! Dot’s coat has a new color.":"章節皇冠！Dot 的大衣換了新顏色。","{n} of 3 stars today. A new case comes tomorrow.":"今天 {n} / 3 顆星。明天有新案件。","Play it again":"再玩一次","Think about what the data showed you.":"想一想資料告訴了你什麼。","How sure are you?":"你有多確定？","Not sure":"不確定","Fairly sure":"還算確定","Very sure":"非常確定","Survey done!":"調查完成！","All cases closed!":"所有案件都破了！","{n} charts made.":"做了 {n} 張圖表。","{chapter}: {n} of {total} stars.":"{chapter}：{n} / {total} 顆星。","Your work is saved. You can go back to your class page now.":"你的作品已儲存。現在可以回到班級頁面了。","(This hint costs the third star.)":"（用這個提示會失去第三顆星。）","Quest Card":"任務卡","Band":"等級","Read aloud":"朗讀","Enter a quest code":"輸入任務代碼","Settings":"設定","Close":"關閉","Four digits from your teacher: chapter, band, mode, case.":"老師給的四位數字：章節、等級、模式、案件。","Delete":"刪除","That is not a case. Check the four digits with your teacher.":"沒有這個案件。請和老師確認四位數字。","Four digits, please.":"請輸入四位數字。","Go":"出發","Sort & Group":"排序與分組","Chart It":"畫成圖表","Clues & Claims":"線索與說法","Clean-Up Crew":"清理小隊","Model Makers":"模型創客","Fair Data":"公平的資料","My Data":"我的資料","Supported":"有根據","Not supported":"沒有根據","Can’t tell yet":"還不能確定","Most kids picked {top}.":"最多小朋友選了{top}。","Fewest kids picked {low}.":"最少小朋友選了{low}。","More than half picked {top}.":"超過一半的人選了{top}。","Our class has the bigger share of {ours}.":"我們班選{ours}的比例比較高。","The other class has the bigger share of {theirs}.":"另一班選{theirs}的比例比較高。","Both classes picked {top} most.":"兩班都最多人選{top}。","Pets at home":"家裡的寵物","Dog":"狗","Cat":"貓","Fish":"魚","Bird":"鳥","Rabbit":"兔子","None":"沒有","Favorite color":"最喜歡的顏色","Red":"紅色","Blue":"藍色","Green":"綠色","Yellow":"黃色","Purple":"紫色","Orange":"橘色","Favorite fruit":"最喜歡的水果","Apple":"蘋果","Banana":"香蕉","Grape":"葡萄","Pear":"梨子","Melon":"哈密瓜","Berry":"莓果","Favorite sport":"最喜歡的運動","Soccer":"足球","Basketball":"籃球","Swimming":"游泳","Tennis":"網球","Running":"跑步","Dance":"跳舞","How we get to school":"我們怎麼上學","Walk":"走路","Bike":"腳踏車","Bus":"公車","Car":"汽車","Scooter":"滑板車","Train":"火車","Our own question":"我們自己的問題","Option A":"選項 A","Option B":"選項 B","Option C":"選項 C","Option D":"選項 D","Option E":"選項 E","Option F":"選項 F","Option G":"選項 G","Option H":"選項 H","The Missing Lunchbox":"不見的便當盒","A lunchbox went missing from the hall after lunch. Here is who was where, and when.":"午餐後，走廊上的便當盒不見了。這裡是誰在什麼時間在哪裡。","Who was last in the hall?":"誰最後一個在走廊？","Sorted by When, the last Hall row is Gus at 3:10. Jo was later, but in the Yard.":"依「時間」排序，最後一列走廊是 3:10 的 Gus。Jo 比較晚，但在操場。","Data is facts in rows":"資料是一列一列的事實","Which column would tell us when each kid was there?":"哪一欄能告訴我們每個人什麼時候在那裡？","The When column is glowing. Tap its header to sort by time.":"「時間」欄在發光。點欄名，依時間排序。","I sorted the table by When for you. Now read the Hall rows from the bottom.":"我幫你把表格依「時間」排好了。從下面往上看走廊的列。","What does sorting a table do?":"把表格排序會怎樣？","Puts the rows in order":"讓各列依順序排好","Deletes rows":"刪除一些列","Adds new facts":"加入新的事實","Gus":"Gus","Jo":"Jo","Eli":"Eli","Who":"誰","Where":"地點","When":"時間","Ari":"Ari","Hall":"走廊","Bo":"Bo","Yard":"操場","Cy":"Cy","Dee":"Dee","Library":"圖書館","Fay":"Fay","Kai":"Kai","Ida":"Ida","Tower Trouble":"高塔之謎","Four teams built block towers. The judge lost the ribbon!":"四隊用積木蓋了高塔。裁判把緞帶弄丟了！","Which team built the tallest tower?":"哪一隊的塔最高？","Sorted by Blocks, the biggest number is 21, and that row is the Foxes.":"依「積木」排序，最大的數是 21，那一列是狐狸隊。","Which column holds the height of each tower?":"哪一欄是每座塔的高度？","Blocks is glowing. Tap it to sort by height.":"「積木」在發光。點它，依高度排序。","Sorted by Blocks for you. The biggest number is at one end.":"我幫你依「積木」排好了。最大的數在其中一端。","To find the biggest number fast, you should…":"想快速找到最大的數，你應該…","Sort by that column":"依那一欄排序","Sort by the first column":"依第一欄排序","Count every row":"把每一列都數一遍","Foxes":"狐狸","Ducks":"鴨子","Frogs":"青蛙","Team":"隊伍","Blocks":"積木","Color":"顏色","Owls":"貓頭鷹","Bees":"蜜蜂","Cats":"貓咪","Pet Parade":"寵物遊行","Every kid in the class drew their pet. Dot wants one number: which pet wins?":"班上每個人都畫了自己的寵物。Dot 只想知道一個數字：哪種寵物最多？","Which pet is most common in the class?":"班上哪種寵物最常見？","Grouped by Pet, the Dog bar is the tallest: 4 kids.":"依「寵物」分組，狗的長條最高：4 個人。","Group counts by kind":"分組能按種類計數","Sorting lists every row. Group puts the rows with the same value together and counts them, so you see how many of each kind.":"排序會列出每一列。分組會把相同值的列放在一起並計數，讓你看到每種有幾個。","Sorting lists every row. What would count the pets instead?":"排序會列出每一列。要怎樣才能數出寵物？","The Group button is glowing. Group by Pet to count each kind.":"「分組」按鈕在發光。依「寵物」分組，數一數每一種。","I grouped the rows by Pet for you. Read the counts.":"我幫你依「寵物」分組了。看看數量。","Grouping by Pet shows you…":"依「寵物」分組可以看到…","How many of each pet":"每種寵物有幾隻","Who has the oldest pet":"誰的寵物年紀最大","The pets in time order":"依時間排列的寵物","Name":"名字","Pet":"寵物","Library Days":"圖書館日","The library keeps a visitor list. Which day needs an extra helper?":"圖書館有一份訪客名單。哪一天需要多一位小幫手？","On which day did the most kids visit?":"哪一天來的小朋友最多？","Grouped by Day, Tuesday has the most visits: 3.":"依「星期」分組，星期二最多人來：3 次。","Do you need the names, or how many per day?":"你需要名字，還是每天有幾個人？","Group is glowing. Group by Day.":"「分組」在發光。依「星期」分組。","Grouped by Day for you. Which bar is tallest?":"我幫你依「星期」分組了。哪一條長條最高？","Which view answers “how many per day?” fastest?":"哪種檢視最快回答「每天幾個人？」","Group by Day":"依星期分組","Sort by Name":"依名字排序","The plain list":"原本的名單","Tuesday":"星期二","Monday":"星期一","Friday":"星期五","Day":"星期","Lu":"Lu","Wednesday":"星期三","Mo":"Mo","Nia":"Nia","Ori":"Ori","Pia":"Pia","Rae":"Rae","Fastest Lap":"最快一圈","Sports day! Everyone ran one lap. One column is just for fun.":"運動會！每個人都跑了一圈。有一欄只是好玩的。","Who ran the fastest lap?":"誰跑一圈最快？","Sorted by Seconds, the smallest number is 45, and that is Uma. Shoes do not matter here.":"依「秒數」排序，最小的數是 45，那是 Uma。鞋子在這裡不重要。","Fastest means the fewest seconds. Which column has seconds?":"最快就是秒數最少。哪一欄是秒數？","Seconds is glowing. Tap it.":"「秒數」在發光。點它。","Sorted by Seconds for you. Fastest is the smallest number.":"我幫你依「秒數」排好了。最快的是最小的數。","Uma":"Uma","Seconds":"秒數","Shoes":"鞋子","Sol":"Sol","Tam":"Tam","Vic":"Vic","Snack Vote":"點心投票","The class voted for a party snack. Dot wants to know what to skip.":"全班投票選派對點心。Dot 想知道哪一種可以不要買。","Which snack did the fewest kids pick?":"哪種點心最少人選？","Grouped by Snack, Crackers has the shortest bar: 1 vote.":"依「點心」分組，餅乾的長條最短：1 票。","Fewest means the smallest count. How do you get counts?":"最少就是數量最小。要怎麼得到數量？","Group by Snack.":"依「點心」分組。","Grouped for you. Look for the shortest bar.":"我幫你分組了。找出最短的長條。","The shortest bar in a group count means…":"分組計數中最短的長條代表…","The fewest of that kind":"那種最少","The most of that kind":"那種最多","A mistake":"有錯誤","Crackers":"餅乾","Fruit":"水果","Popcorn":"爆米花","Snack":"點心","Fruit Bowl":"水果盤","The lunch helper counted fruit picks. Pick the view that shows the winner at a glance.":"午餐小幫手數了大家選的水果。選一個一眼就看出冠軍的檢視。","Which fruit was picked most?":"哪種水果最多人選？","The bar chart shows Grape with the tallest bar: 7.":"長條圖上葡萄的長條最高：7。","Charts show the shape":"圖表呈現形狀","A bar chart turns counts into bars, so the biggest and smallest jump out. A pictograph uses pictures. A table keeps every exact fact.":"長條圖把數量變成長條，最大和最小一眼就看得出來。象形圖用圖案。表格保留每個精確的事實。","Which view shows big and small at a glance?":"哪種檢視一眼看出大和小？","The Bars button is glowing.":"「長條」按鈕在發光。","Switched to bars for you. The tallest bar wins.":"我幫你換成長條了。最高的長條獲勝。","A bar chart is best for…":"長條圖最適合…","Comparing amounts at a glance":"一眼比較數量","Hiding the numbers":"把數字藏起來","Listing every name":"列出每個名字","Kids":"人數","Build the Bars":"做出長條","Dot has the pet counts in a table but the chart is empty. Build it!":"Dot 有寵物數量的表格，但圖表是空的。把它做出來！","Make the bars match the table. Then: which pet is most common?":"讓長條和表格一樣。然後：哪種寵物最常見？","When the bars match the table, Dog is the tallest: 5.":"長條和表格一樣時，狗最高：5。","Each bar should be as tall as its number in the table.":"每條長條的高度要和表格裡的數字一樣。","The Dog stepper is glowing: tap + until Dog shows 5.":"狗的加減鈕在發光：一直按 +，直到狗是 5。","I set Dog to 5 for you. Match the other three.":"我幫你把狗設成 5 了。其他三個也對好。","A bar’s height should equal…":"長條的高度應該等於…","Its number in the table":"它在表格裡的數字","The biggest number":"最大的數","Any height you like":"你喜歡的任何高度","Picture This":"看圖說話","The sports club made a pictograph. Each picture stands for 2 kids.":"運動社做了一張象形圖。每個圖案代表 2 個人。","How many more kids chose Soccer than Swimming?":"選足球的比選游泳的多幾個人？","Soccer has 8 and Swimming has 4. 8 minus 4 is 4.":"足球 8 個，游泳 4 個。8 減 4 是 4。","Which view shows the two amounts side by side? Each picture is 2 kids.":"哪種檢視能把兩個數量並排顯示？每個圖案是 2 個人。","The Pictures button is glowing.":"「圖案」按鈕在發光。","Switched to pictures for you. Soccer 8, Swimming 4: take the smaller from the bigger.":"我幫你換成圖案了。足球 8，游泳 4：用大的減小的。","In this pictograph one picture means…":"在這張象形圖裡，一個圖案代表…","2 kids":"2 個人","1 kid":"1 個人","10 kids":"10 個人","Sport":"運動","Who Picked Grape?":"誰選了葡萄？","A chart is great for amounts, but someone has a question only a table can answer.":"圖表很適合看數量，但有個問題只有表格能回答。","Which kid picked Grape?":"哪個小朋友選了葡萄？","Only the table keeps the names. Nia’s row says Grape.":"只有表格保留名字。Nia 那一列寫著葡萄。","Does a bar chart show names?":"長條圖會顯示名字嗎？","The Table button is glowing.":"「表格」按鈕在發光。","Switched to the table for you. Find the Grape row.":"我幫你換成表格了。找出葡萄那一列。","A chart loses…":"圖表會失去…","The single facts, like names":"單一的事實，例如名字","The totals":"總數","Nothing at all":"什麼都不會失去","The Empty Bar":"空的長條","Color vote! Build the bars and spot the color nobody chose.":"顏色投票！做出長條，找出沒人選的顏色。","Which color did nobody pick?":"哪個顏色沒有人選？","With the bars built, Green stays at 0: nobody picked it.":"長條做好後，綠色停在 0：沒有人選它。","Build each bar to its number. One of them stays flat.":"把每條長條做到它的數字。有一條會是平的。","Green is glowing. Its number is 0.":"綠色在發光。它的數字是 0。","I built Red to 3 for you. Finish the rest, then find the flat bar.":"我幫你把紅色做到 3 了。完成其他的，再找出平的長條。","A bar at 0 means…":"長條是 0 代表…","Nobody picked it":"沒有人選","It was picked most":"最多人選","The data is wrong":"資料錯了","Votes":"票數","The Plant Race":"植物賽跑","Dot measured a bean plant every day for five days.":"Dot 連續五天，每天量一株豆苗。","The plant grows about 2 cm a day.":"這株植物每天大約長高 2 公分。","Each bar is 2 cm taller than the one before: 2, 4, 6, 8, 10. That supports the claim.":"每條長條都比前一條高 2 公分：2、4、6、8、10。這支持了這個說法。","Claims need evidence":"說法需要證據","A claim is something you say is true. The chart is the evidence. It can support the claim, go against it, or be too small to tell yet.":"說法是你說是真的事。圖表就是證據。它可以支持說法、反對說法，或資料太少還不能確定。","How much does each bar grow from one day to the next?":"每條長條從一天到下一天長高多少？","Day 2 and Day 3 are glowing. Compare their heights.":"第 2 天和第 3 天在發光。比較它們的高度。","4 to 6 is 2 more. Every day adds 2. The claim is supported.":"4 到 6 多了 2。每天都多 2。這個說法有根據。","A claim is supported when…":"說法有根據的時候是…","The data shows it":"資料顯示出來","It sounds right":"聽起來是對的","A friend agrees":"朋友也同意","Day 1":"第 1 天","Day 2":"第 2 天","Day 3":"第 3 天","Day 4":"第 4 天","Day 5":"第 5 天","cm":"公分","Bike Rack":"腳踏車架","The caretaker counted bikes at the rack every morning this week.":"工友伯伯這星期每天早上都數了車架上的腳踏車。","Friday is the busiest bike day.":"星期五是腳踏車最多的一天。","Thursday’s bar is the tallest: 15. Friday has 13. The chart goes against the claim.":"星期四的長條最高：15。星期五是 13。圖表反對這個說法。","Which bar is the tallest?":"哪一條長條最高？","Thursday is glowing. Compare it with Friday.":"星期四在發光。和星期五比一比。","Thursday 15 is more than Friday 13, so the claim is not supported.":"星期四 15 比星期五 13 多，所以這個說法沒有根據。","The chart says Thursday 15 and Friday 13. “Friday is busiest” is…":"圖表說星期四 15、星期五 13。「星期五最多」是…","Impossible to check":"無法檢查","Thursday":"星期四","Bikes":"腳踏車","Two Points Is a Hunch":"兩個點只是猜測","A sunflower was measured on two days. Someone is already making a big prediction.":"有一株向日葵只量了兩天。已經有人在做很大的預測了。","It will be 20 cm tall by day 10.":"到第 10 天它會長到 20 公分。","Two bars is a hunch, not a case. We need more days before we can tell.":"兩條長條只是猜測，不能當證據。需要更多天才能判斷。","How many days of data do we have?":"我們有幾天的資料？","Both bars are glowing. Is that enough to see a pattern?":"兩條長條都在發光。這樣夠看出規律嗎？","Two points can make any line. Pick Can’t tell yet.":"兩個點可以畫出任何一條線。選「還不能確定」。","Predict Day 6":"預測第 6 天","Back to the bean plant. Five days are in. What will day 6 measure?":"回到豆苗。五天的資料都有了。第 6 天會量到多少？","Slide to your prediction for day 6, then pin it.":"滑到你對第 6 天的預測，然後釘選。","The plant adds 2 cm a day: 10 on day 5, so day 6 should be about 12.":"植物每天長 2 公分：第 5 天是 10，所以第 6 天應該大約 12。","What is the step from one day to the next?":"從一天到下一天差多少？","Day 4 and Day 5 are glowing: 8 then 10.":"第 4 天和第 5 天在發光：8 然後 10。","10 plus 2 is 12. Slide to 12.":"10 加 2 是 12。滑到 12。","A prediction from a steady pattern is…":"根據穩定規律做的預測是…","A good guess with evidence":"有證據的好推測","Always exactly right":"永遠完全正確","Just luck":"只是運氣","Day 6":"第 6 天","Shoes and Books":"鞋子和書","A class list has shoe sizes and books read this month. Someone sees a link.":"班上的名單有鞋子尺寸和這個月讀的書。有人覺得它們有關係。","Kids with bigger shoes read more books.":"鞋子比較大的小朋友讀比較多書。","Two columns in one table…":"同一個表格裡的兩欄…","Do not have to be connected":"不一定有關係","Are always connected":"一定有關係","Must be sorted together":"一定要一起排序","Shoe size":"鞋子尺寸","Books":"書本","Hair and Laps":"頭髮和圈數","Sports day again. The list has hair color and laps run. A new claim is on the board.":"又是運動會。名單上有髮色和跑的圈數。白板上有一個新說法。","Everyone ran at least 3 laps.":"每個人都至少跑了 3 圈。","The smallest number in Laps is 3, so everyone ran at least 3. Hair color does not come into it.":"「圈數」最小的數是 3，所以每個人都至少跑了 3 圈。髮色跟這無關。","What is the smallest number in the Laps column?":"「圈數」欄最小的數是多少？","Ida and Kai are glowing: the smallest laps.":"Ida 和 Kai 在發光：圈數最少。","The smallest is 3, which is at least 3. Supported.":"最小是 3，也就是至少 3。有根據。","Hair":"髮色","Laps":"圈數","Brown":"棕色","Black":"黑色","Blond":"金色","Twelve Pets":"十二隻寵物","Twelve kids typed their pet. Some typed in a hurry. Clean the list before counting.":"十二個小朋友輸入了自己的寵物。有些人打得很急。數之前先把名單清理乾淨。","How many kids have a dog?":"有幾個小朋友養狗？","After fixing the three misspelled dogs, the Dog group counts 7.":"把三個拼錯的狗改好後，狗這組是 7。","Messy data lies":"髒資料會騙人","Real data has typos, double entries and impossible numbers. Clean it first: fix a typo, merge a duplicate, remove what cannot be true. Then count.":"真實的資料會有打錯字、重複輸入和不可能的數字。先清理：修正錯字、合併重複、刪除不可能是真的東西。然後再數。","Some rows say the same pet in a different way. Can you spot them?":"有些列用不同的寫法寫同一種寵物。你找得到嗎？","The odd rows are glowing. Tap one and fix its spelling.":"奇怪的列在發光。點一列，修正寫法。","I fixed Cy’s row to Dog. Fix the other two, then group by Pet.":"我幫你把 Cy 那列改成狗了。改好另外兩列，再依「寵物」分組。","“dog”, “Dog” and “d0g” should be…":"「ㄍㄡˇ」、「狗」和「狍」應該…","Fixed to one spelling":"改成同一種寫法","Counted as three pets":"算成三種寵物","Removed":"刪除","dog":"ㄍㄡˇ","d0g":"狍","Dgo":"夠","Double Trouble":"重複的麻煩","Which club has the most kids?":"哪個社團人數最多？","Once Ori and Sol are counted once each, Art has 3 and Chess has 2.":"Ori 和 Sol 各算一次後，美術社有 3 人，西洋棋社有 2 人。","Is anyone on the list twice?":"名單上有人出現兩次嗎？","The repeated rows are glowing. Tap one and merge it.":"重複的列在發光。點一列，把它合併。","I merged Ori’s second row. Merge Sol’s, then group by Club.":"我幫你合併了 Ori 的第二列。合併 Sol 的，再依「社團」分組。","A duplicate row should be…":"重複的列應該…","Merged into one":"合併成一列","Counted twice":"算兩次","Fixed to a new name":"改成新名字","Art":"美術","Chess":"西洋棋","Music":"音樂","Club":"社團","Impossible!":"不可能！","Kids typed their age for the reading club. Two numbers cannot be true.":"小朋友為閱讀社輸入了年齡。有兩個數字不可能是真的。","What is the most common age?":"最常見的年齡是幾歲？","99 and 1 cannot be club ages. Without them, age 10 is the biggest group: 4 kids.":"99 和 1 不可能是社員的年齡。去掉它們後，10 歲這組最多：4 個人。","Which ages could not be a kid in this club?":"哪些年齡不可能是這個社團的小朋友？","Two rows are glowing. Tap one and remove it.":"有兩列在發光。點一列，把它刪除。","I removed the 99. Remove the other impossible age, then group by Age.":"我幫你刪除了 99。刪除另一個不可能的年齡，再依「年齡」分組。","An age of 99 in a kids’ club list is…":"兒童社團名單上的 99 歲是…","An impossible value to remove":"要刪除的不可能值","The oldest member":"年紀最大的社員","A typo for 9 that you keep":"是 9 打錯了，要保留","Age":"年齡","The Big Mess":"大混亂","Sports club sign-ups: typos, a double entry and an impossible number, all in one list.":"運動社報名表：打錯字、重複輸入和不可能的數字，全在一張名單裡。","Which sport has the most kids?":"哪項運動人數最多？","Clean, the list has 4 Tennis kids, 3 Soccer and 2 Swimming.":"清理後，名單上網球 4 人、足球 3 人、游泳 2 人。","Look for three kinds of mess: spelling, a repeat, an impossible number.":"找三種混亂：寫法、重複、不可能的數字。","The messy rows are glowing. Fix, merge or remove each one.":"混亂的列在發光。把每一列修正、合併或刪除。","I fixed Lu’s row. Do the other three, then group by Sport.":"我幫你修正了 Lu 那列。處理另外三列，再依「運動」分組。","Which fix is right for an age of 120?":"年齡是 120，怎麼處理才對？","Remove the row":"刪除這一列","Fix the spelling":"修正寫法","Merge it":"合併","soccer":"足求","Tenis":"網毬","Fair Shares":"公平的比例","Two classes counted who walks to school. Class B has more walkers, but it is a bigger class.":"兩個班數了走路上學的人。B 班走路的人比較多，但 B 班人數也比較多。","Which class has the bigger share of walkers?":"哪一班走路上學的比例比較高？","As a share, Class A is 50% and Class B is 40%. More walkers, but a smaller share.":"看比例，A 班是 50%，B 班是 40%。走路的人比較多，但比例比較低。","Counts to percent":"把數量換成百分比","To compare groups of different sizes, turn counts into percent: part divided by whole, times 100. Then every group is out of 100.":"要比較人數不同的組，就把數量換成百分比：部分除以全部，再乘以 100。這樣每組都是以 100 為基準。","12 is more than 10, but the classes are different sizes. What would make them fair to compare?":"12 比 10 多，但兩班人數不同。怎樣比較才公平？","The % button is glowing.":"「%」按鈕在發光。","Switched to percent for you: A 50%, B 40%.":"我幫你換成百分比了：A 50%，B 40%。","Why turn counts into percent?":"為什麼要把數量換成百分比？","To compare groups of different sizes":"才能比較人數不同的組","To make the numbers bigger":"讓數字變大","To remove bad rows":"刪除不好的列","Class A":"A 班","Class B":"B 班","Class":"班級","Tidy, Then Compare":"先整理，再比較","Three classes sent their recycling counts. One row cannot be right. Fix the list, then compare shares.":"三個班送來了回收的數量。有一列不可能是對的。先修正名單，再比較比例。","Which class recycled the biggest share of its lunches?":"哪一班回收的午餐比例最高？","Class C says 30 of 20, which cannot be. Without it: A 75%, B 80%.":"C 班寫 20 份中有 30 份，這不可能。去掉它：A 75%，B 80%。","One class recycled more lunches than it had. Which one?":"有一班回收的午餐比他們有的還多。是哪一班？","Class C is glowing. Remove it, then use %.":"C 班在發光。刪除它，再用「%」。","I removed Class C. Now tap % to compare shares.":"我幫你刪除了 C 班。現在點「%」比較比例。","30 recycled out of 20 lunches is…":"20 份午餐回收了 30 份，這是…","Impossible":"不可能","A great result":"很棒的成績","Class C":"C 班","Recycled":"回收","Lunches":"午餐","Ramp Rule":"斜坡規則","A toy car rolls off a ramp. Dot’s model says the distance it rolls is some number times the ramp height.":"一台玩具車從斜坡滑下來。Dot 的模型說，車子滑的距離是斜坡高度乘以某個數。","Find the number that makes the model fit the trials, then pin the rule.":"找出讓模型符合試驗的數字，然後釘選規則。","With 2 × height the model lands within a few cm of every trial. 1 × is far too short and 4 × far too long.":"用 2 × 高度，模型和每次試驗只差幾公分。1 × 太短，4 × 太長。","A model is a rule that predicts":"模型是能預測的規則","A model is a rule that guesses what will happen. Predict with it, run real trials, compare, then change the rule until the predictions fit. That is refining a model.":"模型是一種猜測會發生什麼的規則。用它預測，做真正的試驗，比較，然後修改規則直到預測符合。這就是改良模型。","Run the trials. Are the model’s predictions too short or too long?":"做試驗。模型的預測太短還是太長？","The rule slider is glowing. Move it one step and run the trials again.":"規則滑桿在發光。移動一格，再做一次試驗。","I set the rule to 2 for you. Run the trials and compare.":"我幫你把規則設成 2 了。做試驗並比較。","When the model’s predictions miss the real results, you should…":"模型的預測和真實結果不一樣時，你應該…","Change the rule and test again":"修改規則，再測一次","Keep the rule and ignore the data":"保留規則，不管資料","Delete the results":"刪除結果","Distance is about 2 × height":"距離大約是 2 × 高度","Distance is about 1 × height":"距離大約是 1 × 高度","Distance is about 4 × height":"距離大約是 4 × 高度","Height":"高度","Distance = {k} × height":"距離 = {k} × 高度","Distance":"距離","Plant Model":"植物模型","Dot grows bean plants in the lab. Her model: height equals some number of cm for every day.":"Dot 在實驗室種豆苗。她的模型：高度是每天長某個公分數。","Fit the growth rule to the five measured plants, then pin it.":"讓生長規則符合五株量過的植物，然後釘選。","At 3 cm a day the model is within 1 cm of every plant. 5 cm a day predicts far too tall.":"每天 3 公分時，模型和每株植物都差不到 1 公分。每天 5 公分會預測得太高。","The model starts at 5 cm a day. Compare its guesses with the real heights.":"模型從每天 5 公分開始。拿它的猜測和真實高度比一比。","The rule slider is glowing. Too tall means a smaller number.":"規則滑桿在發光。太高就表示數字要小一點。","I set the rule to 3 for you. Run the trials and compare.":"我幫你把規則設成 3 了。做試驗並比較。","Your model predicts too tall every time. Refine it by…":"你的模型每次都預測得太高。改良的方法是…","Lowering the growth number":"降低生長數字","Raising the growth number":"提高生長數字","Measuring fewer plants":"少量幾株植物","About 3 cm a day":"每天大約 3 公分","About 5 cm a day":"每天大約 5 公分","About 1 cm a day":"每天大約 1 公分","Days":"天數","Height = {k} cm × days":"高度 = {k} 公分 × 天數","Bounce Back":"彈回來","Drop a ball and it bounces back part of the way. The model: the bounce is some percent of the drop.":"把球丟下去，它會彈回一部分高度。模型：彈起高度是落下高度的某個百分比。","Find the percent that fits the drops, then pin the rule.":"找出符合落下高度的百分比，然後釘選規則。","At 60% every bounce is within 2 cm of the model. 90% and 30% miss by a lot.":"用 60% 時，每次彈起和模型都差不到 2 公分。90% 和 30% 都差很多。","Does the ball bounce most of the way back, or less?":"球會彈回大部分高度，還是比較少？","The rule slider is glowing. Try the middle and refine from there.":"規則滑桿在發光。從中間開始，再慢慢調整。","I set the rule to 60% for you. Run the trials and compare.":"我幫你把規則設成 60% 了。做試驗並比較。","A model that fits five trials well is…":"一個很符合五次試驗的模型是…","Good evidence for the rule":"規則的好證據","Proof it fits every ball ever":"證明它符合所有的球","Useless":"沒有用","The ball bounces about 60% of the drop":"球大約彈回落下高度的 60%","The ball bounces about 90% of the drop":"球大約彈回落下高度的 90%","The ball bounces about 30% of the drop":"球大約彈回落下高度的 30%","Drop":"落下","Bounce = {k}% of the drop":"彈起 = 落下的 {k}%","Bounce":"彈起","Predict Day 12":"預測第 12 天","The bean plants again. Fit the rule, then use the model to predict a day nobody measured.":"又是豆苗。先讓規則符合，再用模型預測一個沒人量過的日子。","Fit the growth rule, slide to your prediction for day 12, then pin it.":"讓生長規則符合，滑到你對第 12 天的預測，然後釘選。","The model that fits is 3 cm a day, so day 12 should be about 36 cm.":"符合的模型是每天 3 公分，所以第 12 天應該大約 36 公分。","First make the model fit the five plants.":"先讓模型符合五株植物。","The rule slider is glowing. When the model fits, 12 days times the rule is your prediction.":"規則滑桿在發光。模型符合後，12 天乘以規則就是你的預測。","I set the rule to 3 for you. 3 times 12 is 36: slide to 36.":"我幫你把規則設成 3 了。3 乘 12 是 36：滑到 36。","A good model lets you…":"好的模型讓你能…","Predict cases you did not measure":"預測沒量過的情況","Skip measuring anything":"什麼都不用量","Change the real results":"改變真實結果","Day 12":"第 12 天","Game Balance":"遊戲平衡","Set the jump power, run 20 test runs, refine, then pin the result.":"設定跳躍力，做 20 次測試，調整，然後釘選結果。","At jump power 8, 16 of 20 runs finish: about 8 in 10. Power 10 lets everyone finish, which is no fun.":"跳躍力 8 時，20 次中有 16 次完成：大約 10 次中 8 次。跳躍力 10 每個人都能完成，那就不好玩了。","Run 20 tests. How many finish? Too many means the game is too easy.":"做 20 次測試。有幾次完成？太多就表示遊戲太簡單。","The jump slider is glowing. Lower it a step and test again.":"跳躍滑桿在發光。降低一格，再測一次。","I set the jump power to 8 for you. Run the tests and count the finishers.":"我幫你把跳躍力設成 8 了。做測試，數一數完成的次數。","Playtest data says 20 of 20 runs finish. The game is…":"試玩資料顯示 20 次中 20 次完成。這個遊戲…","Too easy: refine the jump":"太簡單：調整跳躍","Perfectly balanced":"完美平衡","Too hard":"太難","About 8 in 10 runs finish":"10 次中大約 8 次完成","Every run finishes":"每次都完成","Only half the runs finish":"只有一半完成","Jump power {k}":"跳躍力 {k}","Run":"次","Finished":"完成","Fell":"掉下去","One Grade Asked":"只問了一個年級","I grouped by Grade for you. How many grades are there?":"我幫你依「年級」分組了。有幾個年級？","Grade 3":"三年級","Fair: Soccer won clearly":"公平：足球明顯贏了","Grade":"年級","Pick":"選擇","Tag":"標籤","Who Is Missing?":"誰不見了？","Sorted, the pattern is plain: every No is a veggie eater and every Yes eats meat. The veggie kids were never asked.":"排序後一目了然：每個「否」都是吃素的，每個「是」都吃肉。吃素的小朋友從來沒被問到。","Which kids have No in the Voted column? What do they have in common?":"哪些小朋友在「投票」欄是「否」？他們有什麼共同點？","The Voted column is glowing. Sort by it.":"「投票」欄在發光。依它排序。","I sorted by Voted for you. Read the Lunch column of the No rows.":"我幫你依「投票」排序了。看看「否」那幾列的「午餐」欄。","The veggie eaters never got to vote":"吃素的人沒機會投票","Everyone voted":"每個人都投了票","The meat eaters were left out":"吃肉的人被排除了","Lunch":"午餐","Voted":"投票","Meat":"葷食","Yes":"是","Veggie":"素食","No":"否","Works for Some":"只對某些人有用","A voice helper was tested before launch. It was tested mostly on one kind of voice.":"一個語音助理在推出前做了測試。測試時大多只用一種聲音。","Who does the voice helper fail?":"語音助理對誰沒有用？","As a share: 90% of deep voices worked but only 50% of high voices. Tested mostly on deep voices, it fails the others.":"看比例：低沉的聲音有 90% 成功，高的聲音只有 50%。測試大多用低沉的聲音，所以對其他人不好用。","9 worked and 3 worked, but the groups are different sizes. What makes them fair to compare?":"成功的有 9 個和 3 個，但兩組人數不同。怎樣比較才公平？","Switched to percent for you: 90% against 50%.":"我幫你換成百分比了：90% 對 50%。","To find who a system fails, test it on…":"想知道一個系統對誰沒用，要找…來測試","Many different kinds of people":"很多不同的人","The people who built it":"做出它的人","One kind of voice":"一種聲音","It fails half the high voices":"一半的高音聲音不成功","It works the same for everyone":"對每個人都一樣好用","It fails the deep voices":"低沉的聲音不成功","Testers":"測試者","Worked":"成功","Tested":"測試數","Deep voices":"低沉的聲音","High voices":"高的聲音","Who Else to Ask":"還要問誰","Who is in this survey? Who is not?":"這份調查裡有誰？沒有誰？","Group is glowing. Group by Comes by.":"「分組」在發光。依「怎麼來」分組。","I grouped by Comes by for you: one bar, all Bus. Pick the two groups that are missing.":"我幫你依「怎麼來」分組了：只有一條長條，全是公車。選出缺少的兩組人。","Just as biased":"一樣有偏差","Fair":"公平","Shorter":"比較短","Kids in other grades":"其他年級的小朋友","Kids who walk or bike":"走路或騎腳踏車的小朋友","More Grade 5 bus riders":"更多搭公車的五年級生","The same kids again":"又是同一群小朋友","Comes by":"怎麼來","Grade 5":"五年級","Our Survey":"我們的調查","Real data comes from real people. Count the answers from your class and chart them.":"真實的資料來自真實的人。數一數你們班的回答，畫成圖表。","Enter the tallies with the steppers, make a chart, then pin a claim the chart supports.":"用加減鈕輸入劃記，做一張圖表，再釘選圖表能支持的說法。","The chart says: {top} has the most with {a}, {low} the fewest with {b}, {total} answers in all.":"圖表顯示：{top} 最多，有 {a}；{low} 最少，有 {b}；總共 {total} 個回答。","Collect, chart, claim":"收集、畫圖、提出說法","A survey turns people’s answers into data. Tally each answer, chart the counts, then pin only a claim the chart really shows. Five answers is the least that counts as a case.":"調查把人們的回答變成資料。劃記每個回答，把數量畫成圖表，然後只釘選圖表真正顯示的說法。至少要五個回答才算一個案件。","How many kids picked each one? Add them up with the steppers.":"每一項有幾個人選？用加減鈕加起來。","The Bars button is glowing: a chart shows the shape of your answers.":"「長條」按鈕在發光：圖表能呈現你們回答的形狀。","I switched to bars for you. Which bar is tallest? Pin that claim.":"我幫你換成長條了。哪一條最高？釘選那個說法。","Two kids answered. Is that enough for a claim about the class?":"只有兩個人回答。這樣夠對全班提出說法嗎？","Not yet: ask more kids":"還不夠：多問一些人","Yes, two is plenty":"夠，兩個人就很多了","Only if they agree":"只要他們意見一樣","Another Class":"另一班","A second question for your class. Pro detectives can also load another class and compare shares.":"你們班的第二個問題。高手偵探還可以載入另一班來比較比例。","Tally your class, chart it, and pin a claim. Pro: load the other class and compare by percent.":"劃記你們班、畫成圖表，再釘選說法。高手：載入另一班，用百分比比較。","Count each color with the steppers, then make the chart.":"用加減鈕數每種顏色，再做圖表。","I switched to bars for you. Which bar wins? Pin that claim.":"我幫你換成長條了。哪一條贏了？釘選那個說法。","Two classes of different sizes are compared fairly by…":"公平比較兩個人數不同的班，要看…","Percent of each class":"每班的百分比","Raw counts":"原本的數量","Who shouted loudest":"誰喊得最大聲","Open Tally":"自由劃記","Your own survey. Pick a question, tally the class, chart it, claim it. Make as many charts as you like.":"你自己的調查。選一個問題，劃記全班，畫成圖表，提出說法。想做幾張圖表都可以。","Pick a question first, then count the answers.":"先選一個問題，再數回答。","The Bars button is glowing once you have five answers or more.":"有五個以上的回答時，「長條」按鈕就會發光。","I switched to bars for you. Pin the claim about the tallest bar.":"我幫你換成長條了。釘選關於最高長條的說法。","Crowdsource the class data":"集合全班的資料","Hide the results":"把結果藏起來","Pick a winner":"選出冠軍","This is a Pro chapter. Try it?":"這是高手章節。要試試看嗎？","Not now":"下次再說","Try it":"試試看","“{claim}”":"「{claim}」","It is a tie. Count a few more answers, or pin the tie.":"平手了。再多數幾個回答，或釘選平手。","{a} and {b} are tied for the most.":"{a} 和 {b} 並列最多。","A table holds facts in rows and columns. Sorting puts the rows in order, and grouping counts how many of each kind. Tap a column name to sort by it. The right view makes the answer pop out.":"表格用列和欄來放事實。排序讓各列依順序排好，分組則數出每一種有幾個。點欄名就能依那一欄排序。用對的檢視，答案就會跳出來。","Sorted by Seconds from small to big, the fastest runner is in the…":"依「秒數」從小到大排序，最快的跑者在…","Top row":"最上面一列","Bottom row":"最下面一列","Middle row":"中間一列","Two days of data: 3 cm, then 5 cm. “It will be 20 cm by day 10” is…":"兩天的資料：3 公分，然後 5 公分。「到第 10 天會有 20 公分」是…","Sorted by shoe size, the Books numbers go up and down: 4, 3, 6, 1, 2, 5. No pattern, so not supported.":"依鞋子尺寸排序，書本數字忽高忽低：4、3、6、1、2、5。沒有規律，所以沒有根據。","Does the Books column go up when Shoe size goes up? Sort to find out.":"鞋子尺寸變大時，「書本」欄會變多嗎？排序看看。","Shoe size is glowing. Sort by it, then read the whole Books column.":"「鞋子尺寸」在發光。依它排序，再看完整的「書本」欄。","Sorted by Shoe size for you: 4, 3, 6, 1, 2, 5. No pattern: not supported.":"我幫你依鞋子尺寸排序了：4、3、6、1、2、5。沒有規律：沒有根據。","Laps: 4, 6, 2, 5. “Everyone ran at least 3 laps” is…":"圈數：4、6、2、5。「每個人都至少跑了 3 圈」是…","Not supported: one ran 2":"沒有根據：有一個人跑了 2 圈","The sign-up sheet was passed around twice. Some kids are on it two times.":"報名表被傳了兩次。有些小朋友寫了兩次。","Your team’s runner game is too easy: every playtester reaches the end. Tune the jump so about 8 in 10 test runs finish.":"你們隊的跑酷遊戲太簡單：每個試玩的人都跑到終點。調整跳躍，讓大約 10 次測試中有 8 次完成。","A new recess app was tested only by Grade 3 before launch. Its poster says the whole school loves the soccer button. Here are the test results.":"一個新的下課 App 推出前只有三年級測試過。海報上說全校都愛足球按鈕。這是測試結果。","Was this app tested fairly for the whole school?":"這個 App 有為全校公平地測試嗎？","Grouped by Grade there is one bar: every tester was in Grade 3. The other grades never tried the app.":"依「年級」分組只有一條長條：每個測試者都是三年級。其他年級從沒試過這個 App。","Test technology on everyone":"科技要讓每個人都測試","Apps, games and gadgets are designed from test data. If only one group tests them, they may not work for everyone. Good design is tested by many kinds of people, including people who see, hear or move differently. That is called accessibility.":"App、遊戲和裝置都是根據測試資料設計的。如果只有一群人測試，它們可能不適合每個人。好的設計會讓很多不同的人測試，包括看、聽或行動方式不同的人。這叫做無障礙設計。","Who tested this app? Which column tells you?":"誰測試了這個 App？哪一欄能告訴你？","Group is glowing. Group by Grade to see who tested it.":"「分組」在發光。依「年級」分組，看看是誰測試的。","An app that only Grade 3 tested may not work well for…":"只有三年級測試過的 App，可能不好用的是…","Nobody at all":"完全沒有人","Not fair: only Grade 3 tested it":"不公平：只有三年級測試","Fair: eight kids tested it":"公平：有八個小朋友測試","Burgers won the vote on the new lunch-order screen. But the screen was set up in the meat line, and some kids never got to use it.":"新的午餐點餐螢幕上，漢堡贏了投票。但螢幕放在葷食的隊伍，有些小朋友從來沒用到。","Who was left out of the vote on the screen?":"誰沒能在螢幕上投票？","A game’s red and green clues look the same to some players. The design…":"遊戲裡紅色和綠色的線索，對有些玩家來說看起來一樣。這個設計…","Leaves some players out: add shapes too":"排除了一些玩家：也加上形狀","Is fine for most players":"對大部分玩家沒問題","Is more fun":"比較好玩","The council built a new bike-shed sign-up screen. Every tester came from the Grade 5 bus stop.":"學生會做了一個新的腳踏車棚報名螢幕。每個測試者都來自五年級的公車站。","Pick the two groups who should test the sign-up screen next.":"選出接下來應該測試報名螢幕的兩組人。","Every tester is in Grade 5 and comes by bus. The missing testers are other grades and kids who walk or bike, the very kids who will use the bike shed.":"每個測試者都是五年級、搭公車來的。缺少的是其他年級，還有走路或騎腳踏車的小朋友，也就是會用腳踏車棚的人。","More testers from the same group make a test of new technology…":"從同一群人找更多測試者，會讓新科技的測試…","Pick a question, enter the tallies, make a chart and pin a claim. On the projector, add each chart to the class pool.":"選一個問題，輸入劃記，做一張圖表並釘選說法。在投影機上，把每張圖表加入班級彙整。","Every pair reads its tallies out and the teacher pools them on the projector. That is a way to…":"每一組讀出自己的劃記，老師在投影機上彙整。這是一種…","The chart says: it is a tie at the top with {a} each, {low} the fewest with {b}, {total} answers in all.":"圖表顯示：最多的是平手，各有 {a}；{low} 最少，有 {b}；總共 {total} 個回答。","Kind":"種類"}} });
